# Research (docs/re-party-chat.md): the vanilla Y hint (script 018) from a save; run with --save
include boot_from_save
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
peek u32 0x020B4640 main_ctx
dump 0x02204620 0x5C flags_before
shot v_before
press Y 3
wait 2
peek u32 0x020B4644 hint_ctx
wait 30
shot v_y_30
wait 90
shot v_y_120
press A 3
wait 60
shot v_y_a1
press A 3
wait 60
shot v_y_a2
press A 3
wait 60
shot v_y_a3
peek u32 0x020B4644 hint_ctx_after
dump 0x02204620 0x5C flags_after
